### 🚀 Before Shipping

- [ ] **Player Settings** — `Edit → Project Settings → Player`: set Company Name (`{{ company_name }}`), Product Name (`{{ project_name }}`), app icon, and bundle identifier
- [ ] **Quality Settings** — `Edit → Project Settings → Quality`: tune shadow distance, anti-aliasing, and texture quality per quality level; set the default level for your target hardware
- [ ] **Remove placeholder assets** — delete the generated capsule/sphere meshes and replace with production-ready models; strip any TODO scripts
- [ ] **Profile in Play mode** — `Window → Analysis → Profiler`; target 60 fps on lowest-spec device; watch for GC.Alloc spikes in hot paths
- [ ] **Standalone build test** — `File → Build Settings → Build and Run`; test the .exe / .app outside the editor to catch build-only issues
{% if render_pipeline == "URP" %}
- [ ] **URP tuning** — in the URP Asset (`Project Settings → Graphics`): enable MSAA (4x), configure Shadow Distance (~50m), add a Global Volume with Bloom and Color Grading post-processing
{% elif render_pipeline == "HDRP" %}
- [ ] **HDRP tuning** — configure the HDRP Asset quality levels; add a Sky and Fog Volume; use HDRP Lit materials with proper albedo/smoothness/metallic maps; enable TAA
{% endif %}
{% if platform == "mobile" %}
- [ ] **Mobile input** — add on-screen joystick and button UI using Unity's On-Screen Controls (`Input System → On-Screen Stick / Button`); test with touch simulation in the Game view
- [ ] **Performance budget** — target 30 fps on mid-range device; reduce draw calls with GPU instancing; bake all static lighting; use compressed textures (ASTC for mobile)
- [ ] **Device testing** — connect a physical Android / iOS device; deploy via `Build Settings → Build and Run`; check battery drain and thermal throttling over 15 min sessions
- [ ] **SDK settings** — `Player Settings → Android`: set Min API Level (21+) and Target API Level; for iOS: set Deployment Target (12.0+) and enable Metal
{% endif %}
{% if platform == "webgl" %}
- [ ] **WebGL memory** — in `Player Settings → WebGL`: set Initial Memory Size (256 MB minimum); enable **Brotli** compression for smaller downloads
- [ ] **Local server test** — WebGL builds require a server; run `python -m http.server 8000` in the build folder and open `http://localhost:8000` — never open `index.html` directly from disk
- [ ] **Browser compatibility** — test in Chrome, Firefox, and Safari; Safari has stricter AudioContext rules (audio may require a user gesture to start)
{% endif %}
{% if platform == "console" %}
- [ ] **Certification checklist** — follow the platform holder's Technical Requirements Checklist (TRC/TCR/LotCheck); common failures: missing controller disconnect handling, save data corruption recovery
{% endif %}

