## Troubleshooting

### Visual

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| Player / Enemy appear **pink** | {% if render_pipeline != "builtin" %}Built-in Default-Material not supported in {{ render_pipeline }}{% else %}Missing material reference{% endif %} | Create a {% if render_pipeline == "URP" %}**URP/Lit**{% elif render_pipeline == "HDRP" %}**HDRP/Lit**{% else %}**Standard**{% endif %} material in `Assets/Materials/` and assign it to the MeshRenderer |
| Scene is **completely black** | No light and no skybox | Ensure the Directional Light is active; for 2D check the Camera's Background Color |
| **Skybox missing** / solid grey background | Skybox Material not set | `Window → Rendering → Lighting → Environment → Skybox Material`; assign the default skybox |
{% if render_pipeline != "builtin" %}
| **Shader compilation freeze** on first open | {{ render_pipeline }} compiling all shader variants | Normal — wait 3–10 minutes; subsequent opens are instant |
{% endif %}
| Objects **invisible** but scene looks fine | Wrong layer / culling mask | Check the Camera's Culling Mask includes the object's layer |

### Physics & Movement

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **Player falls through floor** | No ground Collider | Add `GameObject → 3D Object → Plane` with a Collider, layer = Ground |
| Player **won't move** | Script not receiving input{% if "input_system" in features %} / Input System not configured{% endif %} | Check Console for errors; {% if "input_system" in features %}verify `Project Settings → Player → Active Input Handling = Both`{% else %}confirm `GetAxis("Horizontal")` returns non-zero in the Debugger{% endif %} |
| Player **clips through walls** at speed | Rigidbody Continuous collision off | On the Player Rigidbody, set **Collision Detection** to **Continuous** |
| **Rigidbody2D not moving** | Script expects Rigidbody2D but has Rigidbody (3D) | Check the Player GO — it should have a **Rigidbody2D** component for {{ game_type }} games |
| Player **slides with no friction** | No Physics Material | Create a Physics Material (`Assets/Materials/`), set Friction=0.6, assign to CapsuleCollider |
| Player **rotates and falls over** | Rigidbody rotation not frozen | On the Rigidbody, set **Constraints → Freeze Rotation X, Y, Z** |

### AI & Enemies

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **Enemy doesn't chase** the player | Player tag missing or detection radius too small | Select Player GO, set **Tag = Player**; increase `detectionRadius` on the enemy script |
{% if "navmesh" in features %}
| Enemy **stands still**, no pathfinding | NavMesh not baked | `Window → AI → Navigation → Bake`; make sure ground is Navigation Static |
| Enemy **stutters or teleports** | NavMesh too coarse | Lower `Cell Size` in Navigation bake settings; increase `agentRadius` |
{% endif %}
| Enemy **deals no damage** | No HealthSystem on Player | Add `HealthSystem.cs` to the Player GO; the enemy uses SendMessage which silently does nothing if the receiver is absent |
| Enemy **immediately attacks** on spawn | Detection radius too large | Reduce `detectionRadius` on the Enemy script in the Inspector |

### Scripts & Compile Errors

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **"Missing Script"** on a GameObject | CS compile error preventing script load | Open Console (`Window → General → Console`), fix the red error, re-enter Play |
| **NullReferenceException** in PlayerController | Required component not on same GO | The script calls `GetComponent<Rigidbody>()` — verify the Rigidbody is attached |
| **"The type … could not be found"** | Script reference between files broken | Check for typos in class names; ensure the `.cs` filename matches the class name exactly |
| **Animator warnings** (`Animator is not playing…`) | No Animator Controller assigned | Create an Animator Controller in `Assets/Animations/`, assign to the Animator component |
| **"No receiver for SendMessage TakeDamage"** | HealthSystem not on target GO | Add `HealthSystem.cs` to the target object, or change EnemyAI's script to use `DontRequireReceiver` (already set) |

### Camera

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **Camera doesn't follow** the player | Target Transform not assigned | Select Camera GO → Camera script in Inspector → drag Player into **Target** field |
| Camera **snaps, not smooth** | Smooth time too low | Increase `smoothTime` on the camera script (try 0.15 – 0.3) |
| Camera **clips into geometry** | No collision avoidance | Add a `CinemachineCollider` extension if using Cinemachine, or implement a sphere-cast in the camera script |
{% if game_type == "2D" %}
| **Parallax layers** not moving | Wrong script or missing setup | Ensure background sprites are on different Sorting Layers and driven by a parallax script that reads Camera delta |
{% endif %}

### Build & Platform
{% if platform == "mobile" %}

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **Touch input not working** | Using old Input Manager | Add `On-Screen Stick` and `On-Screen Button` from Input System package; or use `Input.GetTouch()` |
| **Build fails on Android** | Missing NDK / SDK | Unity Hub → Installs → Add Modules → Android Build Support (includes NDK, SDK, JDK) |
| **App crashes on launch** (iOS) | Missing permissions plist entry | `Player Settings → iOS → Other Settings → Camera / Microphone Usage Description` |
{% endif %}
{% if platform == "webgl" %}

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------------------|-----|
| **Blank screen** after build | Opened `index.html` from disk | Serve from a local server: `python -m http.server 8000` |
| **Audio silent** | Browser AudioContext policy | Trigger audio only from a user gesture (button click); Unity's `AudioSource.Play()` is gated |
| **Build very large** | Uncompressed textures / audio | Enable **Brotli** compression; use Crunch compression on textures; convert audio to MP3/OGG |
{% endif %}

| Symptom | Most Likely Cause | Fix |
